{"about_the_game":"Infferno is a post apocalyptic isometric top down shooter for 1-2 Coop Players Online or Local Offline<br><br>You guide a character who is trapped in a maze of sinister creatures. The game has a graphic with isometric perspective. From difficult gameplay, the game is full of enemies, as well as a lot of action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211730/extras/01bafc9572a60bf9181db26ad397230c.webp?t=1711257959\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211730/extras/01bafc9572a60bf9181db26ad397230c.poster.avif?t=1711257959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=239 /></picture></span><br><br>The player controls a character that faces various deadly creatures and traps in a dungeon, where each level will discover more enemies and dangers.<br><br>We relied on procedural level generation to add more randomness to our game.<br><br><strong>Features and Content</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels with different themes and enemies<br></li><li>  All level are procedurally and ramdomly generated to add more randomness to each gameplay ( Every game is different - random levels ).<br></li><li>  Amazing Pixel Art</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211730/extras/6de809016462042047bffeca7150dc23.avif?t=1711257959\" width=600 height=683 /></span><br><br>Cross Platform Multiplayer<br>We worked hard to release cross-platform functionality, where you can play with your PC, or you can play with phone device, even multiplayer online with your friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1211730/extras/4cafd8154ce2ed527a17bc319d671833.avif?t=1711257959\" width=600 height=272 /></span><br><br>Controller Support<br>This game has Full Controller Su